<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ's Asian Props says hotel sale delayed.</title>
<headline>NZ's Asian Props says hotel sale delayed.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Properties Ltd said on Thursday the sale agreement of the President Hotel Snd Bhd in Malaysia had been extended for three months to July 3.</p>
<p>The extension was required as the purchaser had appealed against certain aspects of the Malaysian government approvals, Asian Properties said.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
